// A program that runs too long stops with an error
// => error: Stopped after 1000 steps. Is there an endless loop, or more work than one program may do (a long list, a fine spacing)? (line 4, column 22)
// => with: {"maxSteps": 1000}
for (i = [0:100000]) echo_nothing(i);
module echo_nothing(i) {}
